        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we provide active pharmaceutical ingredient contract development and manufacturing services for oligonucleotide-based therapeutic modalities.",
        "start_character": 8576,
        "end_character": 8731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to product sales, we also offer a wide range of services including an exchange and rebuild program, assistance with the design and integration of vacuum systems, applications support and training in basic and advanced vacuum technologies.",
        "start_character": 48585,
        "end_character": 48835
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In each of these research fields, we conduct research that is focused on specific product development for release in the short-term as well as other research that is intended to be the foundation for future products over a longer time-horizon.",
        "start_character": 53115,
        "end_character": 53358
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our companion diagnostics business, we partner with several major pharmaceutical companies to develop new potential pharmacodiagnostics, which may be used to identify patients most likely to benefit from a specific targeted therapy.",
        "start_character": 19367,
        "end_character": 19602
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our primary focus is on biopharmaceutical companies working with advanced therapeutic modalities (e.g., cell and gene therapies) where we provide a suite of research tools and companion diagnostic development services.",
        "start_character": 8357,
        "end_character": 8575
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our contract development and manufacturing organization business, we offer our pharmaceutical customers specialized manufacturing capabilities for targeted therapeutics, including the production of antibody drug conjugates, high potency active pharmaceutical ingredients, and active pharmaceutical ingredients via microbial fermentation.",
        "start_character": 8752,
        "end_character": 9097
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Violations of these laws and regulations could result in fines and penalties, criminal sanctions, restrictions on our business conduct and on our ability to offer our products in one or more countries, and could also materially affect our brand, our ability to attract and retain employees, our international operations, our business and our operating results.",
        "start_character": 60375,
        "end_character": 60735
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also leverage temporary workers to provide flexibility for our business and manufacturing needs.",
        "start_character": 62705,
        "end_character": 62804
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer special industry-focused service bundles that are designed to meet the specific needs of pharmaceutical and biopharmaceutical, advanced materials, environmental and hydrocarbon processing customers to keep instruments fully operational and compliant with the respective industry requirements.",
        "start_character": 37015,
        "end_character": 37321
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that we will continue to have significant research and development expenditures in order to maintain our competitive position with a continuing flow of innovative, high-quality products and services.",
        "start_character": 52605,
        "end_character": 52818
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We deploy a multi-channel approach, marketing products to our customers through direct sales, electronic commerce, resellers, manufacturers' representatives and distributors.",
        "start_character": 22698,
        "end_character": 22872
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001090872-25-000087",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001090872-25-000087-a03c867e90932022",
        "accession_number": "0001090872-25-000087",
